#Objective
Understand and configure :
•	Linux scheduled tasks,
•	automatic executions,
•	execution frequencies.


#Cron Structure
* * * * * command_to_execute
- - - - -
| | | | |
| | | | +---- Day of week
| | | +------ Month
| | +-------- Day of month
| +---------- Hour
+------------ Minute


#Verify Cron Service
sudo systemctl status cron --no-pager
sudo systemctl start cron
sudo systemctl enable cron
sudo systemctl status cron --no-pager


#View Existing Cron Jobs
crontab -l

